# claude-solo-kernel-sample-pass01-2026-10-15

return: review of `10.workshop/10.10.work/10.10.11.solo-kernel/sample/`, the kernel redraft
model: claude (Opus 5.5), claude-opus-5-5
asked by: the Director, in chat on 2026-10-15: "check out 10.10.11.solo.kernel/sample ... I would like your opinion and assessment before we continue." Filing asked: "In both" (this return, and `1008.app-plan/05.04`).
state: return. Not a promote. Not a signature. No file in `solo-kernel/` or either kernel was edited.
verified: run. Python 3.14.7. Read-only scripts compared each sample draft with its seat in `00.00.00.kernel.draft`; `lcheck.py` default run (read-only) on `sample/`. Snapshot about 20:20 on 2026-10-15. The redraft model was still working (`face.py` changed 20:16; `clerk.003.py` appeared during the review). Anything later is not in this return.
not a pack: no pack was built for this. The target was the folder on disk.

## What it is
366 files: 363 drafts `FF.VVV.draft.md` and two book sentinels `00.md`.
Syntax: 16 of the 20 entries in kernel.draft. Missing: `00.REG.md`, `00.retire.09`, `0016.compose`, `0017.dev`.
Law: 55 of the 58 entries, plus a new `1001.accounting`. Missing: `00.axioms`, `00.order.md`, `00.retire.09`.
Also inside: `00.00.01.law.zip`.

Wording compared with the seat (headers and blank lines ignored):
| result | drafts |
| --- | --- |
| same wording, new stamp | 223 |
| small change, 3 lines or fewer | 26 |
| rewritten | 74, of which 53 are face `06` |
| new face, no seat in kernel.draft | 40, mostly `03` (13) and `08` (15) |

Stamps: 258 drafts carry `source path`, `source version`, `source hash`. 288 are seat version plus one. 35 are not.
Checker on `sample/` (default run): face-name error 358 (every `.draft.md` name), dangling-page 3, stale-address 19. The last two look inherited from kernel.draft; not traced one by one.

